{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/2015-05-24---Introducing-VSDiagnostics/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"id":"ca4a819d-7159-5dac-aa96-2e935f28924d","html":"<p>I am happy to announce the first release of <a href=\"https://github.com/Vannevelj/VSDiagnostics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">VSDiagnostics</a>! This project is a group of diagnostics meant for Visual Studio 2015 and up which will help the developer adhere to best practices and avoid common pitfalls.</p>\n<p>These are a few examples of the scenarios currently supported:</p>\n<h2 id=\"if-statements-without-braces\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#if-statements-without-braces\" aria-label=\"if statements without braces permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a><code class=\"language-text\">if</code> statements without braces</h2>\n<p><img src=\"/7b69f198f7e6db4664fe551d5f2c429a/if-without-braces.gif\" alt=\"If statements without braces\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"stringempty-instead-of-an-empty-string\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#stringempty-instead-of-an-empty-string\" aria-label=\"stringempty instead of an empty string permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a><code class=\"language-text\">String.Empty</code> instead of an empty string</h2>\n<p><img src=\"/a3f37737b1fadfd066117e7f8ffa981e/string-dot-empty.gif\" alt=\"String.Empty instead of an empty string\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"argumentexception-that-can-use-nameof\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#argumentexception-that-can-use-nameof\" aria-label=\"argumentexception that can use nameof permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a><code class=\"language-text\">ArgumentException</code> that can use <code class=\"language-text\">nameof()</code></h2>\n<p><img src=\"/e6a9941cd804762748005315492a9202/argumentexception-without-nameof.gif\" alt=\"ArgumentException that can use nameof()\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"a-catch-clause-that-catches-a-nullreferenceexception\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#a-catch-clause-that-catches-a-nullreferenceexception\" aria-label=\"a catch clause that catches a nullreferenceexception permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>A <code class=\"language-text\">catch</code> clause that catches a <code class=\"language-text\">NullReferenceException</code></h2>\n<p><img src=\"/3b74b1672a66aeb2bea94105742dda76/catch-clause-catching-nullreferenceexception.gif\" alt=\"A catch clause that catches a NullReferenceException\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"throwing-an-empty-argumentexception\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#throwing-an-empty-argumentexception\" aria-label=\"throwing an empty argumentexception permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Throwing an empty <code class=\"language-text\">ArgumentException</code></h2>\n<p><img src=\"/7480e2bc2ef8e6e4ef4a638072b4662c/throwing-empty-argumentexception.gif\" alt=\"Throwing an empty ArgumentException\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"catching-exception-without-other-catch-clauses\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#catching-exception-without-other-catch-clauses\" aria-label=\"catching exception without other catch clauses permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Catching <code class=\"language-text\">Exception</code> without other <code class=\"language-text\">catch</code> clauses</h2>\n<p><img src=\"/f33c64ff635d2ecbef402c514f27c94a/catching-exception-without-other-clauses.gif\" alt=\"Catching Exception without other catch clauses\"></p>\n<p>And many more!</p>\n<p>For the full list, take a look at <a href=\"https://github.com/Vannevelj/VSDiagnostics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">the Github page</a>. If you have a suggestion in mind or you are interested in contributing, let me know: I want this to be a community powered project. I hope this first release already proves helpful to you and I’m eager to hear your feedback and criticism.</p>\n<h1 id=\"how-do-i-use-this\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#how-do-i-use-this\" aria-label=\"how do i use this permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>How do I use this?</h1>\n<p>Simply create a new project using Visual Studio 2015 RC and add [the NuGet package](<a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/VSDiagnostics/0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://www.nuget.org/packages/VSDiagnostics/0</a>! If you don’t find it: make sure you’re also looking in the NuGet V2 package source.</p>","fields":{"slug":"/posts/2015-05-24---Introducing-VSDiagnostics/","tagSlugs":["/tag/c/","/tag/roslyn/","/tag/visual-studio/","/tag/diagnostics/"]},"frontmatter":{"date":"2015-05-24T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["C#","Roslyn","Visual Studio","Diagnostics"],"title":"Introducing: VSDiagnostics","description":"I am happy to announce the first release of VSDiagnostics! This project is a group of diagnostics meant for Visual Studio 2015 and up which will help the developer adhere to best practices and avoid common pitfalls.","socialImage":null}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/2015-05-24---Introducing-VSDiagnostics/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["4208939363"],"slicesMap":{}}